        {
          "text": " Kotema Samuel ekek kere loka Isirael atiar, “Arai ibonunito mama ejai EJAKAIT kikusitauon kere, kolemasi idekesio lumo ka Asitarot kamakus, kitemokis ikusitauon mama ejai EJAKAIT, kijaanakis ŋes bon: ŋes da kiyuuni yes kakan naka Ipilisitian.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodete idwe luka Isirael alemar Ibaalin ka Asitarot, kijaanakis EJAKAIT bon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
