        },
        {
          "text": " Kotukokinos Misipa, kookut akipi, kobukosi kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT, kolunata apaaran ŋin, kobalas kanen ebe, “Kidiaka kama ejai EJAKAIT.” Kirabak Samuel idwe luka Isirael koMisipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepuput Ipilisitian ebe etukokina idwe luka Isirael Misipa, koloto iiaka luka Ipilisitian asurokin Isirael. Kepuput idwe luka Isirael, apotu kokuriakata Ipilisitian, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.37.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 37:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobalas idwe luka Isirael Samuel ebe, “Sirikitanan aimony mama ejai EJAKAIT Ewokodeke kanukosi, tetere kitaiari isio kakan naka Ipilisitian.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
