              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Napeinakini Samuel ainakinet naicweio, kikunyut Ipilisitian aitiii Isirael: konye kiretak EJAKAIT Ipilisitian kairetun naepol kapaaran kanin, kitiean kes; kodanyai kes kakonyen nuka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolomasi ituŋa luka Isirael koMisipa, kodapata Ipilisitian, kodanya kes, kiton naadolioto Bet-car.",
