              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinyakakinai Isirael ireria luanatarito Ipilisitian kamakec, anyoun koEkuron kiton Gat; koyu Isirael eikoruke kakan naka Epilisitian. Kinapakina Isirael ka Imorain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
